                                                "example_id": "09985c04-bd15-4e33-8681-f6c9293f6a0f",
                                                "sense_id": "a4264326-8436-3e1d-a246-9fc0fc59ac08",
                                                "text": "When a bundle with a drag coefficient of 200 nN · sec · m⁻¹ (Howard and Hudspeth, 1988) produced a 25 nm, triangle-wave twitch 5 msec in total duration (Fig. 12A), the energy dissipated against viscous drag was ~100 zJ (a zeptojoule is 10⁻²¹ J)."
