                                                "sense_id": "a4264326-8436-3e1d-a246-9fc0fc59ac08",
                                                "text": "The associated work is\nW = 38.5 nm² × (10⁻⁹m/nm)² 35 pN/μm\n(10⁻¹² N/pN) (μm/10⁻⁶ m) = 1.35 × 10⁻²¹ J\nor about one zeptojoule."
                                            },
